# Example Release Keystore Configuration for Jalsah
# To sign your production release APK/AAB:
# 1. Copy this file to 'android/key.properties' (which is git-ignored).
# 2. Fill in the parameters below matching your release keystore:
#
# storePassword=your_keystore_password
# keyPassword=your_key_password
# keyAlias=jalsah_release_key
# storeFile=../jalsah-release-key.jks
#
# Alternatively, you can pass these via environment variables in CI/CD:
# KEYSTORE_PATH, KEYSTORE_PASSWORD, KEY_ALIAS, KEY_PASSWORD
#
# To strictly prohibit falling back to the debug key in CI/CD or production builds:
# export REQUIRE_RELEASE_KEYSTORE=true
